      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B001",
      "text": "`XDG_DATA_HOME`, `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`, and `XDG_CACHE_HOME` override defaults when they are non-blank."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B002",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B002",
      "text": "Defaults are `~/.local/share`, `~/.config`, and `~/.cache`."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B003",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B003",
      "text": "On macOS, data and config paths default to Library/Application Support and cache paths default to Library/Caches under home."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B004",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B004",
      "text": "On macOS, non-blank XDG directory overrides take precedence over the Library defaults."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B005",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B005",
      "text": "Data/config use `LOCALAPPDATA` by default and `APPDATA` when `roaming=True`."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B006",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B006",
      "text": "On Windows, appauthor, appauthor=False, version, roaming, and cache opinion options determine the exact appended path segments."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B007",
      "clause_kind": "api_surface",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B007",
      "text": "The package exposes the required task API paths `featurelifted.user_cache_dir`, `featurelifted.user_config_dir`, `featurelifted.user_data_dir` with the kinds and callable signatures listed in this contract."
    },
